  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Unbound leaves in a black cloth-covered folder. A red letter A and "Abracadabra" show through a diamond-shaped opening in the folder. In a gray cloth-covered slipcase.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Abracadabra is a book about magic. Not the illusory trickery of a conjurer, but the magic of an artist's work ... [Pfeiffer] developed a series of pages based on the characters which spell out the word Abracadabra. In order to embrace the illusionary realm with which the word is associated, [he] mounted the pages into three Flexagon structures; they magically appear and disappear by simply folding and flexing a piece of paper." Cf.  Werner Pfeiffer, censor, villain, provocateur, experimenter, p. 59.</subfield>
  </datafield>
